artifact.prompt:
{
  "name": "create_ticket",
  "description": "Create a support ticket when the user reports a problem that needs follow-up.",
  "input_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "category": {"type": "string", "enum": ["billing", "technical", "account"]},
      "summary":  {"type": "string", "maxLength": 200}
    },
    "required": ["category", "summary"]
  }
}

When a tool fails, the application returns results like:
{"error": "order_not_found", "message": "No order ORD-1942 for this customer. Their recent orders are ORD-1924 and ORD-1880."}
instead of {"error": "500"}.
